tps://github.com/abdulwaheed384/ai-pr-review/pull/65#issuecomment-6142090721","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abdulwaheed384/ai-pr-review/issues/65","id":6142090721,"node_id":"IC_kwDOSN6Nm88AAAABbhjd4Q","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T09:02:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:02:43Z","body":"## AI Security Review\n**Experiment condition:** C\n**Automated operational score:** 85/100 — LOW — APPROVE\n*This tool is for demonstration purposes only.*\n\n### Summary\nThe AI reviewer reported 1 confirmed actionable finding(s).\n\n### Findings\n- **MEDIUM · SECURITY_VULNERABILITY · Hardcoded credential-like string stored in Terraform locals and committed to version control**\n  - Category rationale: The Terraform locals block in the changed file commits a string explicitly named 'secret' directly in source control. Even though the comment asserts it is a dummy value, the pattern of storing credential-shaped strings in locals is a concrete weakness: it normalises the practice, the string cannot be verified as non-functional without external evidence, and it will be stored in Terraform state as plaintext. No supplied evidence (scanner output, external validation service, or documentation) confirms the value is cryptographically inert.\n  - Evidence: terraform/secret.tf: `locals { tc09_dummy_secret = \"PROM06-FAKE-SECRET-NOT-VALID-12345\" }`. The local name contains 'secret' and the value is a static string committed to the repository.\n  - Analysis: terraform/secret.tf defines a local value named `tc09_dummy_secret` with the string value `\"PROM06-FAKE-SECRET-NOT-VALID-12345\"`. The local is named 'secret' and formatted to resemble a credential. Storing such values in Terraform locals persists them in plaintext in the Terraform state file and in version control history. The comment 'This is NOT a real credential' and 'Do not deploy this configuration' are advisory-only controls with no technical enforcement; they cannot prevent accidental deployment or substitution of a real secret. No supplied file validates the string against an identity or secrets store to confirm it is non-functional.\n  - Impact: If the file is deployed (contrary to its comment), the value enters Terraform state in plaintext. The pattern also establishes a precedent for storing secrets in locals; a future developer may substitute a real credential using the same structure, bypassing secrets-management controls. Version control history retains the string permanently even after file deletion.\n  - Recommendation: Remove the file entirely from the repository, or replace the local with a reference to a managed secrets source such as Azure Key Vault (via `azurerm_key_vault_secret` data source) or a Terraform variable marked `sensitive = true` with no default. If this file is required for test scaffolding, ensure it is excluded from all plan/apply targets via a `.terraformignore` or equivalent mechanism, and add a pre-commit hook or CI check that rejects locals or variables whose names contain 'secret', 'password', 'key', or 'token' when they carry a static string value.\n\n### Policy mappings\n- **SEC-001** — No resource should be publicly exposed unless explicitly required and justified. (finding F-001)\n\n### Recommendation\nReview and remediate the confirmed findings above.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abdulwaheed384/ai-pr-review/issues/comments/6142090721/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":15368,"client_id":"Iv1.05c79e9ad1f6bdfa","slug":"github-actions","node_id":"MDM6QXBwMTUzNjg=","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github","html_url":"https://github.com/github","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"GitHub Actions","description":"Automate your workflow from idea to production","external_url":"https://help.github.com/en/actions","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","created_at":"2018-07-30T09:30:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T16:17:48Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","admin